A column after an astral character is one code point

```
{title="😀"}{.b
            .c}
p
.
<p title="😀" class="b c">p</p>
```

```
> {.a}{title="𝒜𝒜"}{.b
>                   .c}
> p
.
<blockquote><p class="a b c" title="𝒜𝒜">p</p></blockquote>
```

```
{title="😀"}{.b
           .c}
p
.
<p>{title=“😀”}{.b
.c}
p</p>
```

```
::: |
😀	x
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>😀&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;x</p>
</div>
```
